{
    "title": "Fury Watch Face",
    "description": "\u2605 <b>Fury Watch Face is fully Wear OS supported</b>\r\n\r\nNEW! Completely new redesigned Fury watch face!. Fury watch face for Wear OS is a mix of elegant and digital interactive functions.\r\nWatch face contains a huge number and user friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.\r\nThe watch face contains 3 tap targets on the screen and you can customize them to be more informative which includes various number of data such as <b>battery level status, FIT data, weather information, etc.</b>. \r\nThe <b>Wear OS</b> comes with external complication which this watch face supports completely. \r\n\r\n\u2605  Compatible with all WearOS watches\r\n\u2022 External complications\r\n     \u2022 Background types (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022 Change color \r\n     \u2022 24 hour format\r\n     \u2022 Leading zero\r\n     \u2022 Screen time\r\n     \u2022 Forecast (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022 Full ambient mode option (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022 Change a color preset on tap (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022 Tap indicator (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022  Google FIT integration (Premium option) \r\n     \u2022  Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units) (Premium option) \r\n\r\n\u2605 NEW (Premium option) \u2605\r\n  \u2022  Vibrate on every hour\r\n\r\n\u2605  <b>Built-in Free complications:</b>\r\n  \u2022 Weather\r\n  \u2022 Watch battery\r\n  \u2022 Phone battery\r\n\r\n\u2605  <b>Built-in Premium complications:</b>\r\n  \u2022 Watch and phone battery\r\n  \u2022 Steps\r\n  \u2022 Distance\r\n  \u2022 Walking\r\n  \u2022 Running\r\n  \u2022 Biking\r\n  \u2022 Calories\r\n  \u2022 Fit statistics\r\n  \u2022 HeartRate detector\r\n  \u2022 Steps counter from wear device (built-in steps)\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 DISCLAIMER \u2605\r\nThe free version doesn't have a tap functionality. It just shows data and the user is not able to change it until unlock the PREMIUM version.\r\nThe phone battery indicator works only if you connect the smartwatch to Android phone device.\r\n\r\n<b>The watch face CANNOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, ..) or any other OS except Wear OS </b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605 <b>Fury Watch Face is fully Wear OS supported</b><br><br>NEW! Completely new redesigned Fury watch face!. Fury watch face for Wear OS is a mix of elegant and digital interactive functions.<br>Watch face contains a huge number and user friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.<br>The watch face contains 3 tap targets on the screen and you can customize them to be more informative which includes various number of data such as <b>battery level status, FIT data, weather information, etc.</b>. <br>The <b>Wear OS</b> comes with external complication which this watch face supports completely. <br><br>\u2605  Compatible with all WearOS watches<br>\u2022 External complications<br>     \u2022 Background types (Premium option) <br>     \u2022 Change color <br>     \u2022 24 hour format<br>     \u2022 Leading zero<br>     \u2022 Screen time<br>     \u2022 Forecast (Premium option) <br>     \u2022 Full ambient mode option (Premium option) <br>     \u2022 Change a color preset on tap (Premium option) <br>     \u2022 Tap indicator (Premium option) <br>     \u2022  Google FIT integration (Premium option) <br>     \u2022  Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units) (Premium option) <br><br>\u2605 NEW (Premium option) \u2605<br>  \u2022  Vibrate on every hour<br><br>\u2605  <b>Built-in Free complications:</b><br>  \u2022 Weather<br>  \u2022 Watch battery<br>  \u2022 Phone battery<br><br>\u2605  <b>Built-in Premium complications:</b><br>  \u2022 Watch and phone battery<br>  \u2022 Steps<br>  \u2022 Distance<br>  \u2022 Walking<br>  \u2022 Running<br>  \u2022 Biking<br>  \u2022 Calories<br>  \u2022 Fit statistics<br>  \u2022 HeartRate detector<br>  \u2022 Steps counter from wear device (built-in steps)<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b><br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br>\u2605 DISCLAIMER \u2605<br>The free version doesn&#39;t have a tap functionality. It just shows data and the user is not able to change it until unlock the PREMIUM version.<br>The phone battery indicator works only if you connect the smartwatch to Android phone device.<br><br><b>The watch face CANNOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, ..) or any other OS except Wear OS </b><br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
